  "description": "ALL IN. ALL OUT. When the trail gets steeper, faster, and more technical, the MACINA PROWLER comes into its own. With 180 mm of travel up front and 170 mm at the rear, it is uncompromisingly designed for demanding enduro trails. The optimized geometry meets the proven STRAIGHT-LINE-LINK (SLL) suspension concept, delivering sensitive response, maximum traction, and control. The proven DiMMiX (Dimension-Mix) combines a 29-inch front wheel for stability and precise handling with an agile 27.5-inch rear wheel for optimal traction and direct power transfer. Power comes from the Bosch Performance Line CX-R, delivering up to 120 Nm of torque, 750 watts of maximum motor power, and 600% support. The 800 Wh PowerTube provides the range for long days on the trail and can be conveniently removed upwards from the downtube thanks to POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL).",
